      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765631909600000
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 18931,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765631915800000
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help you with that. Can I get your name and the item you're looking to return?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765631917800000
    },
    {
      "text": "It's a Trail Helmet.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 18931,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765631924266666
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I see your account. To make sure I understand correctly, what specifically is the issue? Is it a technical fault with the helmet or more of a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765631925799999
    },
    {
      "text": "Preference. The color is just not right.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 18931,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765631936599999
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand that aesthetics are important. I do just want to mention that this particular helmet has our highest-rated MIPS safety system, which is a fantastic feature for trail riding.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765631939466665
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever. Look, the box is unopened. Can I return it or not?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
